# WarriorCast3SkillsMagical (20610, Sentinel Of Water, level 31, its shipped DD magic), every draw
# 0, 300 away from the character. Its first hit finds it hating no one, so it only takes the
# Warrior's hate; the second, by the character it now hates most from farther than 100, also
# wants its DD magic (4002) on the character, weight 1000000.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCast3SkillsMagical.WarriorCast3SkillsMagical
npc sentinel 20610 Monster 300 0 0 skill DD_MAGIC 4002 3

hit sentinel 80
  desires sentinel attack(player)=1000
hit sentinel 80
  desires sentinel attack(player)=2000 cast(player,4002,move)=1000000
